#: ../../library/smtpd.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`!smtpd` --- SMTP Server"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/smtpd.rst:10
msgid ""
"This module is no longer part of the Python standard library. It was "
":ref:`removed in Python 3.12 <whatsnew312-removed>` after being deprecated "
"in Python 3.6.  The removal was decided in :pep:`594`."
msgstr ""
"ਇਹ ਮੋਡੀਊਲ ਹੁਣ Python ਮਿਆਰੀ ਲਾਇਬ੍ਰੇਰੀ ਦਾ ਹਿੱਸਾ ਨਹੀਂ ਹੈ। ਇਸ ਨੂੰ Python 3.6 "
"ਵਿੱਚ ਅਪ੍ਰਚਲਿਤ ਕਰਨ ਤੋਂ ਬਾਅਦ :ref:`Python 3.12 ਵਿੱਚ ਹਟਾ ਦਿੱਤਾ ਗਿਆ "
"<whatsnew312-removed>`। ਇਸ ਨੂੰ ਹਟਾਉਣ ਦਾ ਫ਼ੈਸਲਾ :pep:`594` ਵਿੱਚ ਕੀਤਾ ਗਿਆ ਸੀ।"

#: ../../library/smtpd.rst:14
msgid ""
"A possible replacement is the third-party :pypi:`aiosmtpd` library. This "
"library is not maintained or supported by the Python core team."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/smtpd.rst:17
msgid ""
"The last version of Python that provided the :mod:`!smtpd` module was "
"`Python 3.11 <https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/smtpd.html>`_."
msgstr ""
